# Pairs with NoSecretMaterial. The record carries the request's payload (a
# rule body, a manifest, a credential) rather than allow-listed identifiers
# and scalars.
MODULE: AuditIntentCopiesPayload
TARGET: NoSecretMaterial
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the intent copies the request payload into the record
PERTURBS: BeginIntent

--- FIND
!.actor = op[o].caller, !.secret = FALSE, !.long = FALSE]]
--- REPLACE
!.actor = op[o].caller, !.secret = TRUE, !.long = FALSE]]
--- END
